OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland has no unique
OL,4,Astudent 'brain drain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no student "brain drain"
OL,7,Fspecific to Northern Ireland, according
OL,8,Fto experts.
OL,10,FBrain drain is a phrase often used to
OL,11,Fdescribe the numbers of students who
OL,12,Fleave Northern Ireland to study and
OL,13,Flive elsewhere.
OL,15,FBut in-depth research for the
OL,16,FDepartment for the Economy (DfE) has
OL,17,Fsuggested that proportionally fewer
OL,18,Fstudents leave Northern Ireland than
OL,19,Fsome other parts of the UK.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
