OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland has no unique
OL,4,Astudent 'brain drain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, about one-third of Northern
OL,7,FIrish graduates are over-qualified for
OL,8,Fthe jobs they work in.
